{
  "v": 2,
  "order": 155,
  "label": "Cubes: records with their own lists and tables",
  "group": "Tables",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "noteIntro",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 108,
      "init": {
        "label": "Records that carry their own lists and tables",
        "body": "A Cube row can hold a list or a whole table in one cell, so each record keeps its own history however long it is. A **Formula** column in Cube Input reads it one row at a time: `@homework` is this student's scores and `@lots` this holding's purchase lots. Any list or table function works per row, and a bare column name reads every row at once.\n\nOpen either Cube Input to see the data and the Fx columns.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 180
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteGrades",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": 579,
      "y": 166,
      "init": {
        "label": "A gradebook",
        "body": "Each student has their own lists of homework, quiz and exam scores, and the counts differ. `homework_avg` averages all but the two lowest homeworks: `LARGE(@homework, SEQUENCE(COUNT(@homework) - 2))` is this student's top scores, however many they turned in. `missing` counts the zeros, `momentum` is the slope of the quiz scores, and `grade` weights the three categories 25/25/50.\n\nDownstream, the grades chart sorted, and **Check in with** lists anyone under 75, missing two or more homeworks, or trending down. The pivots take the score lists whole: a period's homework average pools every score its students turned in, the way `AVERAGE(@homework)` reads one student.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 255,
        "color": "teal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "grades",
      "type": "CubeInputNode",
      "x": 579,
      "y": 583,
      "init": {
        "label": "Gradebook",
        "cubeText": "{\n \"columns\": [\n  {\n   \"name\": \"student\",\n   \"type\": \"string\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"period\",\n   \"type\": \"string\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"homework\",\n   \"type\": \"number\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"quizzes\",\n   \"type\": \"number\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"exams\",\n   \"type\": \"number\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"homework_avg\",\n   \"expr\": \"ROUND(AVERAGE(LARGE(@homework, SEQUENCE(COUNT(@homework) - 2))), 1)\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"missing\",\n   \"expr\": \"COUNTIF(@homework, 0)\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"quiz_trend\",\n   \"expr\": \"SPARKLINE(@quizzes)\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"momentum\",\n   \"expr\": \"ROUND(SLOPE(@quizzes, SEQUENCE(COUNT(@quizzes))), 1)\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"grade\",\n   \"expr\": \"ROUND(0.25 * @homework_avg + 0.25 * AVERAGE(@quizzes) + 0.5 * AVERAGE(@exams), 1)\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"letter\",\n   \"expr\": \"IFS(@grade >= 90, \\\"A\\\", @grade >= 80, \\\"B\\\", @grade >= 70, \\\"C\\\", @grade >= 60, \\\"D\\\", TRUE, \\\"F\\\")\"\n  }\n ],\n \"rows\": [\n  {\n   \"student\": \"Ana\",\n   \"period\": \"Period 1\",\n   \"homework\": [\n    95,\n    88,\n    0,\n    92,\n    100,\n    90,\n    85,\n    94\n   ],\n   \"quizzes\": [\n    78,\n    82,\n    85,\n    90,\n    94,\n    96\n   ],\n   \"exams\": [\n    84,\n    91\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"student\": \"Ben\",\n   \"period\": \"Period 2\",\n   \"homework\": [\n    70,\n    0,\n    65,\n    0,\n    72,\n    60,\n    0\n   ],\n   \"quizzes\": [\n    88,\n    80,\n    74,\n    70,\n    66,\n    61\n   ],\n   \"exams\": [\n    72,\n    64\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"student\": \"Chloe\",\n   \"period\": \"Period 1\",\n   \"homework\": [\n    100,\n    98,\n    97,\n    100,\n    95,\n    99,\n    100,\n    96\n   ],\n   \"quizzes\": [\n    95,\n    97,\n    93,\n    98,\n    96,\n    99\n   ],\n   \"exams\": [\n    96,\n    94\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"student\": \"Dev\",\n   \"period\": \"Period 2\",\n   \"homework\": [\n    80,\n    85,\n    0,\n    78,\n    82,\n    88,\n    84\n   ],\n   \"quizzes\": [\n    70,\n    72,\n    71,\n    75,\n    74\n   ],\n   \"exams\": [\n    79,\n    81\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"student\": \"Elif\",\n   \"period\": \"Period 1\",\n   \"homework\": [\n    60,\n    72,\n    75,\n    81,\n    85,\n    90,\n    92,\n    95\n   ],\n   \"quizzes\": [\n    58,\n    64,\n    70,\n    77,\n    83,\n    88\n   ],\n   \"exams\": [\n    68,\n    85\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"student\": \"Finn\",\n   \"period\": \"Period 2\",\n   \"homework\": [\n    90,\n    92,\n    85,\n    0,\n    0,\n    88,\n    91,\n    87\n   ],\n   \"quizzes\": [\n    85,\n    87,\n    84,\n    80,\n    76,\n    72\n   ],\n   \"exams\": [\n    88,\n    79\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"student\": \"Gia\",\n   \"period\": \"Period 1\",\n   \"homework\": [\n    75,\n    78,\n    80,\n    77,\n    74,\n    79,\n    81,\n    76\n   ],\n   \"quizzes\": [\n    81,\n    79,\n    83,\n    80,\n    82,\n    84\n   ],\n   \"exams\": [\n    77,\n    80\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}"
      }
