    {
      "id": "notePort",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1718,
      "init": {
        "label": "A portfolio with tax lots",
        "body": "Each holding keeps its purchase lots as a table (shares, price paid) and a year of monthly closes as a list. `cost` multiplies the lot table's two columns, and `harvestable` is the loss sitting in lots bought above today's price, the ones worth selling for a tax loss. `drawdown` is the worst fall from a running peak: `@history / SCAN(0, @history, LAMBDA(peak, x, MAX(peak, x))) - 1`.\n\n**By kind** pivots the holdings into funds, stocks and bonds: each kind's share of the total value, its gain and its loss to harvest.\n\nChange a `price` in the Cube Input and every chart and total follows.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 280,
        "color": "amber"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "port",
      "type": "CubeInputNode",
      "x": 519,
      "y": 2102,
      "init": {
        "label": "Holdings",
        "cubeText": "{\n \"columns\": [\n  {\n   \"name\": \"ticker\",\n   \"type\": \"string\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"kind\",\n   \"type\": \"string\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"price\",\n   \"type\": \"number\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"lots\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"history\",\n   \"type\": \"number\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"shares\",\n   \"expr\": \"SUM(CHOOSECOLS(@lots, 1))\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"cost\",\n   \"expr\": \"SUM(CHOOSECOLS(@lots, 1) * CHOOSECOLS(@lots, 2))\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"value\",\n   \"expr\": \"@shares * @price\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"gain\",\n   \"expr\": \"@value - @cost\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"harvestable\",\n   \"expr\": \"SUM(FILTER(CHOOSECOLS(@lots, 1) * (@price - CHOOSECOLS(@lots, 2)), CHOOSECOLS(@lots, 2) > @price, 0))\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"trend\",\n   \"expr\": \"SPARKLINE(@history)\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"drawdown\",\n   \"expr\": \"ROUND(MIN(@history / SCAN(0, @history, LAMBDA(peak, x, MAX(peak, x))) - 1), 3)\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"weight\",\n   \"expr\": \"ROUND(@value / SUM(value), 3)\"\n  }\n ],\n \"rows\": [\n  {\n   \"ticker\": \"VTI\",\n   \"kind\": \"Fund\",\n   \"price\": 240,\n   \"lots\": [\n    [\n     40,\n     180\n    ],\n    [\n     15,\n     225\n    ],\n    [\n     25,\n     210\n    ]\n   ],\n   \"history\": [\n    220,\n    228,\n    250,\n    262,\n    256,\n    245,\n    230,\n    224,\n    236,\n    241,\n    238,\n    240\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ticker\": \"VXUS\",\n   \"kind\": \"Fund\",\n   \"price\": 58,\n   \"lots\": [\n    [\n     100,\n     52\n    ],\n    [\n     60,\n     56\n    ]\n   ],\n   \"history\": [\n    55,\n    57,\n    61,\n    63,\n    62,\n    60,\n    56,\n    54,\n    55,\n    57,\n    59,\n    58\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ticker\": \"BND\",\n   \"kind\": \"Bond\",\n   \"price\": 72,\n   \"lots\": [\n    [\n     80,\n     81\n    ],\n    [\n     50,\n     74\n    ],\n    [\n     40,\n     70\n    ]\n   ],\n   \"history\": [\n    78,\n    77,\n    76,\n    74,\n    73,\n    72,\n    71,\n    71,\n    72,\n    73,\n    72,\n    72\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ticker\": \"AAPL\",\n   \"kind\": \"Stock\",\n   \"price\": 205,\n   \"lots\": [\n    [\n     20,\n     130\n    ],\n    [\n     10,\n     190\n    ],\n    [\n     8,\n     198\n    ]\n   ],\n   \"history\": [\n    170,\n    182,\n    195,\n    210,\n    225,\n    231,\n    214,\n    198,\n    190,\n    197,\n    203,\n    205\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ticker\": \"NVDA\",\n   \"kind\": \"Stock\",\n   \"price\": 110,\n   \"lots\": [\n    [\n     60,\n     45\n    ],\n    [\n     20,\n     135\n    ]\n   ],\n   \"history\": [\n    60,\n    78,\n    96,\n    118,\n    132,\n    140,\n    128,\n    104,\n    95,\n    99,\n    106,\n    110\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ticker\": \"TSLA\",\n   \"kind\": \"Stock\",\n   \"price\": 190,\n   \"lots\": [\n    [\n     12,\n     265\n    ],\n    [\n     8,\n     175\n    ]\n   ],\n   \"history\": [\n    250,\n    262,\n    240,\n    215,\n    230,\n    205,\n    180,\n    172,\n    168,\n    176,\n    185,\n    190\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}"
      }
